# Documentation rules

## Do not auto-generate unless asked

- Root README, CHANGELOG, ADRs, migration guides
- Duplicate architecture docs outside `.cursor/docs/`

## When docs are requested

- User-facing long docs → `Docs/` folder
- Agent baseline → `.cursor/docs/` and `.cursor/rules/`
- Keep minimal and actionable; no boilerplate Contributing/License sections

## This project baseline

The `.cursor/` folder is the intentional agent baseline (architecture, infra, domain). Update those files when making significant structural changes.
